OL,3,GNEWSABacking for city council to take
OL,4,Aon refugee support role
OL,5,
OL,6,FA city council has backed a move to
OL,7,Ftake over support services for refugees
OL,8,Fafter Lancashire County Council
OL,9,Fannounced it would "step back" from the
OL,10,Fco-ordinating role.
OL,12,FDuring a public meeting at Preston City
OL,13,FCouncil, four of the five parties
OL,14,Frepresented at the Labour-led town hall
OL,15,Fsupported a motion to approach the
OL,16,Fgovernment about co-ordinating
OL,17,Fresettlement programmes currently
OL,18,Fassisting 745 people in the county.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
