OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSABacking for city council to take
OL,4,Aon refugee support role
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe majority of the support schemes
OL,7,Frelate to Afghans who assisted British
OL,8,Fmilitary operations in their home
OL,9,Fcountry, who have since been granted
OL,10,Fthe right to live in the UK.
OL,12,FLast month, the Reform UK-led county
OL,13,Fcouncil said it would withdraw from
OL,14,Fthat role by the end of March 2027.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
